  "title": "Zucchini Casserole with Stuffing",
  "description": "This zucchini casserole recipe with cream of mushroom soup, sour cream, onions, and carrots, is topped with a buttery breaded stuffing-like mixture.",
  "authors": [
    "Bea Gassman"
  ],
